@startuml
title How I audit a source file
participant "Main" as Main
participant "project : Directory" as Project
participant "src : Directory" as Src
participant "payment : SourceCodeFile" as File
participant "security : SecurityAuditVisitor" as Audit

Main -> Project : accept(security)
activate Project
Project -> Audit : visit(project)
Project -> Src : accept(security)
activate Src
Src -> Audit : visit(src)
Src -> File : accept(security)
activate File
File -> Audit : visit(payment)
activate Audit
Audit -> Audit : Check credential and high-risk flags
deactivate Audit
File --> Src
deactivate File
Src --> Project
deactivate Src
note over Project
  I use the same accept call for each remaining child.
end note
Project --> Main
deactivate Project
Main -> Audit : report()
Audit --> Main : Security findings
@enduml
